    # "That's... disturbing."
    "그거... 섬뜩하군."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:948
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_b0b44ff1:

    # "As we entered the kitchen, I heard the slamming of the cleaver as we looked to find one of the dead,"
    "주방에 들어서자, 식칼이 내리쳐지는 소리가 들렸고, 우리가 보니 망자 중 하나가,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:950
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_f0272186:

    # "a huge, decrepit, bulking figure hacking away at a man."
    "거대하고, 쇠약하고, 육중한 형체가 한 남자를 난도질하고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:951
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_ec7e5b88:

    # "Still barely alive and choking on blood, the man reached out towards us in one desperate final act, only for the creature to hack off his fingers with the cleaver."
    "아직 간신히 살아서 피에 질식하며, 남자는 마지막 절망적인 행동으로 우리에게 손을 뻗었지만, 괴물은 식칼로 그의 손가락을 잘라버렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:952
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_e99e910f:

    # "As the fingers dropped to the floor, the ghoulish creature turned towards us, placing down a platter of the man's remains on the table,"
    "손가락이 바닥에 떨어지자, 그 섬뜩한 괴물은 우리 쪽으로 돌아서서, 남자의 잔해가 담긴 쟁반을 테이블 위에 내려놓고,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:953
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_b108b59f:

    # "it then stared blankly towards us, expectantly."
    "그리고는 기대에 찬 표정으로 멍하니 우리를 응시했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:954
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_64cf87e1:

    # MARKUS @ scared "Does... Does this fucking thing expect us to eat that?!"
    MARKUS @ scared "저... 저 망할 게 우리보고 그걸 먹으라는 거야?!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:957
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_53d44a4b:

    # "Carefully, I reached over to grab a piece of the meat."
    "조심스럽게, 나는 손을 뻗어 고기 한 조각을 집었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:958
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_2f9ce75e:

    # "With a shaky hand, I pushed the wet meat into my mouth as the creature offered a drooling grin of approval."
    "떨리는 손으로, 나는 축축한 고기를 입에 밀어 넣었고, 괴물은 침을 흘리며 승인의 미소를 지었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:959
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_ed932dcd:

    # "Markus pulled back in revulsion as Kiara looked like she was about to hurl."
    "마르쿠스는 혐오감에 물러섰고, 키아라는 곧 토할 것 같은 표정이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:960
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_2bce3932:

    # "The wet meat squeelched between my teeth, almost making me wretch as my eyes began to water from the foul taste."
    "축축한 고기가 이 사이에서 찌걱거리며, 역겨운 맛에 눈물이 날 지경으로 구역질이 날 뻔했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:961
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_cf947b80:

    # KIARA @ sad "Oh gods... I might... I think I'm gonna be sick."
    KIARA @ sad "오 신이시여... 나... 나 토할 것 같아."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:962
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_d069021e:

    # MARKUS @ scared "What in the hells is wrong with you?"
    MARKUS @ scared "도대체 너한테 무슨 문제가 있는 거야?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:963
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_d73d8a37:

    # SYPHA @ think "... Is this is some kind of masochistic ritual humans perform?"
    SYPHA @ think "... 이게 인간들이 하는 일종의 마조히즘 의식인가?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:966
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_18ca7ff7:

    # VES @ think "... Why no salt?"
    VES @ think "... 왜 소금이 없지?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:968
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_c5034d4e:

    # "Seemingly satisfied that I had tasted his *food,* the creature went back to cooking, seemingly ignoring us and allowing us to pass."
    "내가 그의 *음식*을 맛본 것에 만족한 듯, 괴물은 요리로 돌아가 우리를 무시하며 지나가게 해주었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:972
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_806c733b:

    # "The ghoulish dead creature stared for a moment,"
    "그 섬뜩한 망자 괴물은 잠시 노려보다가,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:973
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_1eb9fc7b:

    # "and realizing none of us will eat its {i}food,{/i}"
    "우리 중 아무도 그 {i}음식{/i}을 먹지 않을 것임을 깨닫고는,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:974
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_5633d180:

    # "it grabbed for the cleaver and swung it wildly towards us!"
    "식칼을 집어 들고 우리를 향해 미친 듯이 휘둘렀다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:982
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_4dc50c36:

    # "Stumbling backwards, blood running from the seeping gash in its head from where I struck,"
    "뒤로 비틀거리며, 내가 가격한 머리의 베인 상처에서 피가 흘러나오는 가운데,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:983
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_4e90e46e:

    # "in the creature's final moments, it reached up to grab a chunk of meat, stuffing its mouth full of it before it fell silent."
    "괴물은 마지막 순간에 손을 뻗어 고기 덩어리를 집어 입에 가득 쑤셔 넣고는 조용해졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:990
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_cupboards_57333fb4:

    # "The cupboards bled and were filled with nothing but pungent meat in a gory mess."
    "찬장들은 피를 흘리고 있었고, 역겨운 고기만이 끔찍한 난장판 속에 가득했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:991
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_cupboards_529ca2a3:

    # MC "(I think I'll pass on dessert.)"
    MC "(디저트는 사양할게.)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:996
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_pot_4b656435:

    # MC "A boiled, severed head floated to the top of the blood stew."
    MC "삶은 잘린 머리가 핏빛 스튜 위로 떠올랐다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1001
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_table_0fe1d924:

    # "{i}Why does no one believe me?{/i}"
    "{i}왜 아무도 나를 믿지 않는 걸까?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1002
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_table_00252d94:

    # "{i}We buried the servant boy the other day, mother says his lungs were sick.{/i}"
    "{i}얼마 전 하인 소년을 묻었어, 엄마는 폐가 아팠다고 했어.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1003
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_table_e5462dc5:

    # "{i}I swear I saw him move, but no one believed me.{/i}"
    "{i}정말 그가 움직이는 걸 봤는데, 아무도 믿지 않았어.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1004
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_table_d7e1df6c:

    # "{i}I dreamed he was still moving in that box, and he came to see me that night.{/i}"
    "{i}꿈에서 그가 여전히 그 상자 안에서 움직이고 있었고, 그날 밤 나를 보러 왔어.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1005
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_table_d2e54c8d:

    # "{i}He was all mangled and gross, I screamed, but he was gone when mother came...{/i}"
    "{i}그는 완전히 찌그러지고 끔찍했어, 나는 비명을 질렀지만, 엄마가 왔을 땐 사라져 있었어...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1012
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_to_cellar_9dd37f09:

    # MC @ think "Damn, it's locked!"
    MC @ think "젠장, 잠겼어!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1017
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_to_cellar_d24c6466:

    # "The door clicked as it unlocked."
    "문이 딸깍 소리를 내며 열렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1026
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_cellar_barrel_61b14339:

    # "No wine, only blood it seems... warm to the touch."
    "와인은 없고, 피만 있는 듯... 만져보니 따뜻했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1032
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_dead_mercenary_5b189511:

    # "Inspecting the corpse of the man, I found clutched in his coiled, dead hand, the blue skull key."
    "남자의 시체를 살펴보니, 굳어버린 죽은 손에 푸른 해골 열쇠가 쥐어져 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1039
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_library_oneoff_b461b23a:

    # "Upon entering the room, the swarm of dead shuffling around turned their attention towards us!"
    "방에 들어서자, 주변을 서성이는 망자 떼가 우리에게 주의를 돌렸다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1049
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_library_fireplace_9aefa7d9:

    # "A still-lit fireplace."
    "아직 타고 있는 벽난로."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1050
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_library_fireplace_a3ca41df:

    # "The fire crackled as it burned the wood, but it radiated no warmth."
    "장작이 타며 불이 타닥거렸지만, 온기는 전혀 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1055
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_library_bookshelf_1_29465ee2:

    # "The pages were ruined and covered in blood."
    "페이지들은 망가져 피로 뒤덮여 있었다."
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l2_library_portrait_dcac9c61:

    # "There's no keyhole this time."
    "이번에는 열쇠 구멍이 없다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1082
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_start_e6b4e9df:

    # MC @ surprised "Gods, what is this place?"
    MC @ surprised "세상에, 여긴 대체 뭐 하는 곳이지?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1083
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_start_594000fe:

    # MC @ think "Does anyone-"
    MC @ think "누구 있어-?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1085
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_start_af6f165f:

    # "As I turned to look back, I realized the others were not with me."
    "뒤를 돌아보니, 다른 이들이 나와 함께 있지 않다는 것을 깨달았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1086
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_start_0ce3e770:

    # MC @ surprised "Markus?"
    MC @ surprised "마르쿠스?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1087
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_start_3e21602a:

    # MC @ surprised "Kiara?"
    MC @ surprised "키아라?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1089
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_start_3ef76725:

    # MC @ surprised "{i}Anyone?{/i}"
    MC @ surprised "{i}아무도 없어?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1091
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_start_cbea66c9:

    # MC @ serious "... Fuck."
    MC @ serious "... 씨발."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1092
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_start_8bdaee21:

    # MC "(Alright, you know what to do. Find the key, move onto the next floor.)"
    MC "(좋아, 뭘 해야 할지 알지. 열쇠를 찾아서 다음 층으로 가는 거야.)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1093
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_start_d7232d72:

    # MC @ sad "(I just hope the others are fine.)"
    MC @ sad "(다들 무사하길 바랄 뿐이다.)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1099
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_bathtub_c67fdbca:

    # "The water is black..."
    "물이 검다..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1105
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_mirror_0d811e85:

    # "Looking into it, I saw my own reflection, but it was distorted."
    "들여다보니, 내 모습이 비쳤지만 일그러져 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1109
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_mirror_44dde62d:

    # "As I placed my hand onto the mirror, I felt it go {i}through{/i} the glass into the other side."
    "거울에 손을 대자, 유리를 {i}뚫고{/i} 반대편으로 들어가는 것이 느껴졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1110
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_mirror_8f466d6a:

    # "It was cool, and as I pushed my hand deeper, I grabbed at something."
    "차가웠고, 손을 더 깊이 밀어 넣자 무언가를 움켜잡았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1112
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_mirror_a6a16a82:

    # "Pulling my hand and whatever it was out, something clawed at me!"
    "손과 거기에 들린 무언가를 빼내자, 무언가가 나를 할퀴었다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1115
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_mirror_eaf73d4a:

    # MC @ surprised "AHH!"
    MC @ surprised "아악!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1116
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_mirror_84c4e35d:

    # "I ripped back my hand, staring at the gash of blood."
    "나는 손을 홱 빼내고, 피가 흐르는 상처를 바라봤다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1117
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_mirror_cc6cfb05:

    # "Clutched in my hand, though, was a small, strange totem."
    "하지만 내 손에는 작고 기이한 토템이 쥐어져 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1119
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_mirror_b7b8af7c:

    # MC "(What is this?)"
    MC "(이게 뭐지?)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1122
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_mirror_6fab40d8:

    # "(Probably not a good idea.)"
    "(아마 좋은 생각은 아닐 거야.)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1158
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_bathroom_415eeec1:

    # MC "(She's coming!)"
    MC "(그녀가 오고 있어!)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1161
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_bathroom_a6b7cd71:

    # "I hid behind the bath."
    "욕조 뒤에 숨었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1164
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_bathroom_7681aefe:

    # "Crouched beside it, the figure entered the bathroom and peered around, looking for me."
    "욕조 옆에 웅크린 채, 그 형체가 욕실에 들어와 나를 찾아 주변을 살폈다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1166
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_bathroom_767c5417:

    # "Crouched down behind the bathtub, the figure glanced from left to right for a moment before, thankfully, shuffling off."
    "욕조 뒤에 웅크린 채, 그 형체는 잠시 좌우를 훑어보다가 다행히 질질 끌며 걸어갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1174
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_bathroom_4cbc2d3b:

    # "Deciding there was no point in hiding, I readied myself to try and slip past her!"
    "숨어봤자 소용없다고 판단하고, 그녀 옆을 빠져나갈 준비를 했다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1176
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_bathroom_5ad74a8f:

    # "Barging through the figure, I barely managed to dodge the snap of her blades as I escaped!"
    "그 형체를 뚫고 달려나가며, 간신히 그녀의 칼날이 찰칵 닫히는 걸 피해 도망쳤다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1184
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_diningroom_134a3e83:

    # MC @ scared "(I need to hide!)"
    MC @ scared "(숨어야 해!)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1190
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_diningroom_38cbb1be:

    # "Dropping to my knees, I crawled beneath the table and waited with bated breath."
    "무릎을 꿇고 식탁 아래로 기어들어가 숨죽여 기다렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1194
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_diningroom_f75a4f61:

    # "As I heard the sound of the shear blade snapping draw closer, the door to the dining room was kicked in as the figure walked on by."
    "가위날이 찰칵거리는 소리가 가까워지자, 그 형체가 지나가며 식당 문을 발로 차고 들어왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1195
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_diningroom_1010a24a:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "Precious... Where are you precious?"
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "소중한 것아... 어디 있니, 소중한 것아?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1196
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_diningroom_95eeac9e:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "Come... Let granny take care of you forever!"
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "이리 오렴... 할미가 영원히 돌봐주마!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1197
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_diningroom_2f4f3719:

    # "They stopped for a moment, looking around, before moving on into the next room."
    "그들은 잠시 멈춰 주변을 둘러보다가, 다음 방으로 이동했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1200
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_diningroom_31130542:

    # MC "(That was close...)"
    MC "(아슬아슬했어...)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1207
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_diningroom_2300535e:

    # "I grabbed the nearest chair,"
    "가장 가까운 의자를 집어 들었다,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1209
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_diningroom_6959b464:

    # "As the door burst open, I flung it towards her before fleeing!"
    "문이 터져 열리자, 도망치기 전에 그녀에게 집어 던졌다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1211
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_diningroom_476cb8e0:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "YOU CAN'T RUN FOREVER!"
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "영원히 도망칠 순 없단다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1220
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_kitchen_077c9c3b:

    # MC "(I can hear her coming!)"
    MC "(그녀가 오는 소리가 들려!)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1224
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_kitchen_7cc40527:

    # "I crawled beneath the kitchen table and waited, hoping the monstrous figure would simply pass on by."
    "부엌 식탁 아래로 기어들어가, 그 괴물 같은 형체가 그냥 지나가길 바라며 기다렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1228
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_kitchen_76c47b00:

    # "The kitchen door swung open, shears snapping violently and tormentingly as she walked,"
    "부엌 문이 열리고, 그녀가 걸으며 가위가 격렬하고 고통스럽게 찰칵거렸다,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1229
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_kitchen_86895518:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "There's no need to run!"
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "도망칠 필요 없단다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1230
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_kitchen_fba385a5:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "You'll make lots of friends with the other children!"
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "다른 아이들과 친구도 많이 사귈 수 있을 거야!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1233
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_kitchen_c51bbaec:

    # "Granny Oh Dreary passed on by without noticing me... For now."
    "오 드리어리 할미는 나를 눈치채지 못하고 지나갔다... 지금은."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1239
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_kitchen_906d9207:

    # "Quickly, I moved to push the table against the door, blockading it."
    "재빨리 식탁을 문 쪽으로 밀어 막았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1241
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_kitchen_3c3c1697:

    # "From the other side, I could hear loud banging on the door."
    "반대편에서 문을 크게 두드리는 소리가 들렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1242
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_kitchen_c379ad4a:

    # MC @ serious "(It won't hold long.)"
    MC @ serious "(오래 버티지 못할 거야.)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1243
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_kitchen_8754c925:

    # MC @ serious "(I need to get out of here!)"
    MC @ serious "(여기서 나가야 해!)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1251
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_cellar_bc8f7802:

    # MC @ scared "(Shit! She's coming!)"
    MC @ scared "(젠장! 그녀가 온다!)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1255
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_cellar_77fbc12d:

    # "Crouched down, I hide behind some of the many rows of potions and strange bottles."
    "웅크려서, 여러 줄의 물약과 이상한 병들 뒤에 숨었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1259
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_cellar_8ba4c879:

    # "As the door opened, the figure stepped inside, shears snapping as she looked from left to right."
    "문이 열리자, 그 형체가 안으로 들어서며 가위를 찰칵거리며 좌우를 살폈다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1260
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_cellar_cd5316aa:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "Are you here, deary?"
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "여기 있니, 귀여운 것아?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1261
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_cellar_97223560:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "Come give granny a hug!"
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "와서 할미한테 안겨보렴!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1264
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_cellar_c8c5fa4d:

    # "I pulled back at the last second as she looked towards me, and as I did so, I heard the snapping sound grow distant as she moved on."
    "그녀가 내 쪽을 바라볼 때 마지막 순간에 뒤로 물러섰고, 그러자 그녀가 이동하며 찰칵거리는 소리가 멀어지는 걸 들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1270
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_cellar_a284fed4:

    # "I didn't hesitate, grabbing the nearest bottle and launching it towards her as soon as she entered the room."
    "망설이지 않고, 그녀가 방에 들어서자마자 가장 가까운 병을 집어 그녀에게 던졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1272
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_cellar_1aaab80a:

    # "By pure luck, the bottle {i}somehow{/i} seemed to actually hit her."
    "순전한 운으로, 병이 {i}어쩐지{/i} 정말로 그녀에게 맞은 것 같았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1276
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_cellar_6ad10df8:

    # "She screamed and wailed as it sizzled her, white steam rising from her as she seemed to shimmer."
    "그녀가 비명을 지르고 울부짖으며 지글거렸고, 하얀 김이 올라오며 그녀가 반짝이는 듯했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1277
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_cellar_0582b976:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "GAHHH! NAUGHTY! NAUGHTY FUCKING BRAT!"
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "가아악! 버릇없어! 버릇없는 망할 녀석!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1280
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_cellar_78e6daf4:

    # "She retreated... For now, at least."
    "그녀는 물러났다... 적어도 지금은."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1281
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_cellar_4250636f:

    # MC "(Too bad I didn't douse my sword in whatever that was first.)"
    MC "(아쉽게도 검에 그게 뭐였든 먼저 묻히지 않았네.)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1288
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_library_3f5054a7:

    # "{i}*SNAP!*{/i}"
    "{i}*째깍!*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1289
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_library_147920de:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "Come out, prettyyyy!"
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "나오렴, 이쁜이이이!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1290
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_library_98f0f9eb:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "Don't hide from grandmaaa!"
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "할미한테 숨지 마아아!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1296
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_library_78c77d80:

    # "Crouched down, I watched and waited patiently as Granny entered the library."
    "웅크린 채, 할미가 서재에 들어올 때까지 참을성 있게 지켜봤다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1297
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_library_cb478fab:

    # "She glanced left."
    "그녀는 왼쪽을 봤다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1298
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_library_46553a4a:

    # "Then right."
    "그 다음 오른쪽."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1301
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_library_a27d0a99:

    # "Then slowly turned to leave as I breathed a sigh of relief."
    "그러고 천천히 돌아서 떠나자, 안도의 한숨을 내쉬었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1310
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_library_f1839d3d:

    # "I timed it perfectly, waiting carefully for her to enter the room. Crouched low, I moved as silently as possible."
    "타이밍을 완벽하게 맞춰, 그녀가 방에 들어올 때까지 조심히 기다렸다. 낮게 웅크려, 가능한 조용히 움직였다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1313
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_library_1c2cbc14:

    # "Before she knew it, I had managed to slip behind her and hurry out."
    "그녀가 알아채기도 전에, 나는 그녀 뒤로 빠져나가 서둘러 나왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1323
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_wrongchoice_5282681b:

    # "As Granny lunged towards me, the strange totem began to glow brightly,"
    "할미가 내게 달려들자, 이상한 토템이 밝게 빛나기 시작했다,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1324
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_wrongchoice_99fcaa70:

    # "and as it did so, Granny shielded her eyes and fled from the room!"
    "그러자, 할미는 눈을 가리고 방에서 도망쳤다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1330
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_wrongchoice_0b5a0ed1:

    # "As the totem dimmed, it cracked, crumbling away in my hands."
    "토템이 어두워지자, 금이 가며 내 손에서 부서져 내렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1331
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_granny_wrongchoice_eb97fb6f:

    # MC "(... The totems... I need to find more of them if I can!)"
    MC "(... 토템들... 가능하면 더 찾아야 해!)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1348
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_toys_4cc3a2b0:

    # "Dolls."
    "인형들."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1349
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_toys_8be0926e:

    # "... Oh gods."
    "... 오 신이시여."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1350
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_toys_c4fb2060:

    # "Are those... {i}faces stitched to the dolls?{/i}"
    "저게... {i}인형에 얼굴을 꿰맨 건가?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1355
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_2aac05f3:

    # "Inside the crib was a doll clutching a small, diamond-head-shaped key."
    "아기 침대 안에는 작은 다이아몬드 머리 모양의 열쇠를 쥔 인형이 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1360
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_9014a260:

    # "I grabbed hold of the key."
    "열쇠를 움켜잡았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1366
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_6e176177:

    # "As I took the key, from the shadowed corner of the room, I heard rocking."
    "열쇠를 집자, 방의 그늘진 구석에서 흔들의자가 삐걱거리는 소리가 들렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1368
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_10844fab:

    # "Reaching for my blade, I turned to see a hunched, shrouded figure sitting in a rocking chair."
    "검에 손을 뻗으며 돌아보니, 굽은 채 로브를 두른 형체가 흔들의자에 앉아 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1369
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_cb4235c7:

    # "Had she been here this whole time?"
    "그녀가 내내 여기 있었던 건가?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1370
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_66840beb:

    # MC @ think "... Hello?"
    MC @ think "... 여보세요?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1371
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_a86fe40a:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "..."
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1372
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_b18389e7:

    # "The woman stopped rocking in her chair."
    "여자가 의자 흔들기를 멈췄다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1373
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_2548988e:

    # MC @ scared "... I'm looking for-"
    MC @ scared "... 전 찾고 있는 게-"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1374
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_3fd19343:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "Do you know my song?"
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "내 노래를 아느냐?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1375
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_bde6c2b6:

    # MC @ think "What?"
    MC @ think "뭐?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1376
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_f49508d7:

    # "I felt the air suck from the room as I took a step back."
    "한 걸음 물러서자 방 안의 공기가 빨려나가는 듯했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1377
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_ebf60601:

    # "The hair stood on end."
    "머리카락이 곤두섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1378
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_639f7396:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "Granny Oh Dreary, don't let children grow..."
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "오 드리어리 할미, 아이들 자라지 못하게 하네..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1380
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_c25bbe0f:

    # "The woman rose from her rocking chair. She was tall... {i}too tall.{/i}"
    "여자가 흔들의자에서 일어났다. 그녀는 컸다... {i}너무 컸다.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1381
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_c5a9bee6:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "Snips off their faces so no one will know."
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "얼굴을 싹둑 잘라 아무도 모르게 하네."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1382
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_d462b8b0:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "Stay little, stay sweet, don't ever get tall…"
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "작게 있어, 달콤하게 있어, 절대 크지 말아라…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1383
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_96d74cac:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "Her dolls on the shelf used to speak, after all!"
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "선반 위 인형들도 예전엔 말을 했었지, 결국엔!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1384
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_881e3d92:

    # "From under her robes came the sharp glint of a huge pair of shears."
    "그녀의 로브 아래에서 거대한 가위의 날카로운 빛이 번뜩였다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1385
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_832ccf11:

    # GRANNY_OH_DREARY "Stitch up your smile, pull tight at the seam—"
    GRANNY_OH_DREARY "네 미소를 꿰매고, 솔기를 꽉 당겨라—"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1386
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_2ae64287:

    # MC @ scared "... Oh fuck."
    MC @ scared "... 오 젠장."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1388
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_f15e001d:

    # "I stepped back, retreating as she pressed the blades together, grinning a hideous, oversized smile."
    "뒤로 물러서며, 그녀가 칼날을 맞붙이며 끔찍하게 과장된 미소를 지을 때 도망쳤다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1389
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_crib_93b00313:

    # "And as she inched closer, I could see {i}she was wearing someone's face.{/i}"
