# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1452
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_portrait_c1e28182:

    # "(Was she real? Or just something we told ourselves to scare each other?)"
    "(그녀는 진짜였을까? 아니면 그냥 서로 겁주려고 지어낸 이야기였을까?)"
# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1459
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_kitchen_cupboards_7cb9fb82:

    # "The cupboards were filled with various preserved jars and fragrant herbs."
    "찬장은 여러 보존병과 향긋한 허브로 가득했다."
