# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1491
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_cellar_paper_14d34baa:

    # "Upon closer inspection of the desk, I found a box of keys with some kind of strange mechanism attached to it."
    "책상을 자세히 살펴보니, 이상한 장치가 달린 열쇠 상자가 있었다."
