translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_cellar_paper_2655275c:

    # "I took the cat key, and as I did so, the mechanism triggered and locked the other keys into place."
    "고양이 열쇠를 집자, 장치가 작동하며 다른 열쇠들이 제자리에 잠겼다."
# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1506
