translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_library_bookshelf_2_164c835c:

    # "There's something hidden between the books, a small, strange totem-like item that I feel compelled to take with me."
    "책들 사이에 뭔가 숨겨져 있다. 작고 이상한 토템 같은 물건인데, 꼭 가져가야 할 것 같은 느낌이 든다."
# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1551
