translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_study_desk_d684e48c:

    # "Placed carefully onto the shrine, there was a pink skull key next to a small journal."
    "제단 위에 조심히 놓인, 작은 일기장 옆에 분홍색 해골 열쇠가 있었다."
# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1578
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_study_desk_86c19707:

    # "{i}Why... Why did they need to tell me that awful story?{/i}"
    "{i}왜... 왜 그 끔찍한 이야기를 나한테 해줘야 했을까?{/i}"
# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1579
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_study_desk_55d99166:

    # "{i}Every night now, I see her at my window.{/i}"
    "{i}이제 매일 밤, 창문 너머로 그녀가 보여.{/i}"
# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1580
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_study_desk_7c86294c:

    # "{i}Granny Oh Dreary asking me to let her in.{/i}"
    "{i}오 드리어리 할미가 들여보내 달라고 해.{/i}"
# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1581
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_study_desk_048768af:

    # "{i}I don't think she's real yet... But...{/i}"
    "{i}아직 진짜인 것 같진 않은데... 하지만...{/i}"
# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1582
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_study_desk_0b7dca96:

    # "{i}The more I think about her, the more real she becomes...{/i}"
    "{i}그녀에 대해 생각할수록, 점점 더 진짜가 되어가...{/i}"
# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1583
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_study_desk_f55152da:

    # "{i}Why... Why does this keep happening to me?{/i}"
    "{i}왜... 왜 자꾸 나한테 이런 일이 일어나는 걸까?{/i}"
# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1587
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_bedroom_door_9a6b2bca:

    # MC "(I need the key to unlock this!)"
    MC "(이걸 열려면 열쇠가 필요해!)"
# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1591
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_bedroom_door_b5f1c5ad:

    # "Inserting the key into the lock, the door swung open as I scrambled through,"
    "열쇠를 자물쇠에 넣자, 문이 활짝 열려 허겁지겁 통과했다,"
# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1594
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_bedroom_door_d7c3a363:

    # "a bright white light enveloping me as I stepped inside."
    "안으로 들어서자 밝은 하얀 빛이 나를 감쌌다."
# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1601
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l3_bedroom_door_47c33d96:

    # "It is clearly not a key to this door..."
