translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l4_table_menu_6a8f6446:

    # "I grasp at my throat, tightening as hot steam rises from my mouth, sizzling."
    "목을 움켜잡고, 뜨거운 증기가 입에서 올라와 지글거리며 조여온다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1883
