# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1885
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l4_table_menu_68a7f742:

    # "Then I feel it—that burning from the inside as I begin to melt, Shyahtan panicking, desperately trying to contain it, but it's hopeless."
    "그리고 나는 느낀다—녹아내리기 시작하는 그 내부로부터의 타오름을. 샤흐탄은 당황하며 필사적으로 억제하려 하지만, 가망이 없다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:1886
translate kr qst_dreamhouse_l4_table_menu_5d085cab:

    # "Whatever I just drank, it's... It's..."
